OL,3,GNEWSAPolice issue description of man
OL,4,Afeared to have been swept out to sea in
OL,5,ALargs
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice have issued a description of a
OL,8,Fman believed to be have been swept out
OL,9,Fto sea in North Ayrshire during stormy
OL,10,Fweather.
OL,12,FThe white man in his 20s, who was
OL,13,Fdressed all in black, is thought to
OL,14,Fhave gone into the water at about 00:01
OL,15,Fafter large waves struck the coast
OL,16,Faround Burnlea Road in Largs.
OL,18,FThe coastguard confirmed that a
OL,19,Fhelicopter and aeroplane were sent in
OL,20,Fresponse, as well as rescue teams from
OL,21,FLargs and Ardrossan, and RNLI lifeboats
OL,22,Ffrom Largs and Troon.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
