OL,3,GNEWSAPolice issue description of man
OL,4,Afeared to have been swept out to sea in
OL,5,ALargs
OL,6,
OL,7,FA spokesperson said no-one was found
OL,8,Fafter an extensive search and searches
OL,9,Fwere suspended at about 09:00, pending
OL,10,Fany new information.
